  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "How do I reserve?",
      "a": "All reservations are made through Resy. With only twelve seats and four seatings a night, we recommend booking ahead, especially for weekends."
    },
    {
      "q": "How long is dinner?",
      "a": "Each seating runs at a set time so the whole counter moves through the omakase together. Please arrive a few minutes early. Courses begin promptly."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can you accommodate allergies or dietary restrictions?",
      "a": "Please note any allergies in your Resy reservation or call us at (917) 675-6355 before your visit so the chef can prepare. Omakase is a raw-fish focused menu, so some restrictions may be difficult to accommodate."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which omakase should I choose?",
      "a": "The 13-course is a lighter evening. For most adults with a healthy appetite, our guests recommend the 18-course."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I book the whole counter?",
      "a": "Yes. Use the private dining form below to ask about buyouts of all twelve seats for birthdays, celebrations and corporate dinners."
    }
  ],
